---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Pricing — TotalRecalls" description="One-time $24 launch price. No subscription. No cloud locker.">

  <h1>Pricing</h1>
  <p>TotalRecalls is a small Windows app that saves your ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, and Grok conversations into a private folder on your computer — readable Markdown + JSON you keep forever.</p>
  <p>No subscription. No cloud locker. No account required.</p>

  <section class="price-card">
    <h2>Launch Price</h2>
    <div class="price-block">
      <span class="price-strike"><strike>$49</strike></span>
      <span class="price-current" data-tr-price></span>
      <span class="price-badge">launch price</span>
    </div>
    <p class="price-note">One-time purchase · Windows app · Local files only</p>
    <p>Pay once with Lemon Squeezy. Download the Windows app. Export your AI conversations locally, on your PC.</p>
    <p><a href="/buy/" class="buy-button buy-lg" data-tr-buy>Buy TotalRecalls — $<span data-tr-price></span></a></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What You Get</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Export from ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini (Takeout), Grok</li>
      <li>Local Markdown + JSON files</li>
      <li>Private folder structure you own</li>
      <li>No cloud storage</li>
      <li>No telemetry</li>
      <li>No recurring fees</li>
      <li>Free minor updates during the launch period</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Why One-Time Pricing?</h2>
    <p>TotalRecalls is a utility, not a subscription service. You pay once, download the app, and keep your archive forever.</p>
    <p>Later, when advanced features arrive (semantic search, Obsidian/Notion sync, RAG containers, multi-device memory), those will be <strong>optional upgrades</strong> — not required for basic exporting.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Why $24?</h2>
    <p>The normal price is $49, but early adopters get a launch discount:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>To reduce friction</li>
      <li>To gather feedback</li>
      <li>To build the first user base</li>
      <li>To reward early supporters</li>
      <li>To accelerate development of new features</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>The price will return to $49</strong> after the launch window.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Simple Commercial Deal</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>One payment</li>
      <li>No monthly "AI archive" subscription</li>
      <li>No seat tax</li>
      <li>No upsells</li>
      <li>No hidden fees</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Just a Windows app that saves your AI conversations into files you own.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="footer-cta" style="background: var(--color-midnight); color: var(--color-surface); text-align: center;">
    <h2 style="color: var(--color-surface);">Ready to own your AI conversations?</h2>
    <div class="price-block" style="justify-content: center;">
      <span class="price-strike"><strike>$49</strike></span>
      <span class="price-current" data-tr-price></span>
      <span class="price-badge">launch price</span>
    </div>
    <a href="/buy/" class="buy-button buy-lg" data-tr-buy>Buy TotalRecalls — $<span data-tr-price></span></a>
    <p><a href="/download/" style="color: var(--color-surface);">Already purchased? Download ZIP</a></p>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
